---
import PreviewFrame from './PreviewFrame.astro';
interface Props { welcome?: boolean }
const { welcome = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="feature feature-sage" id="tabs"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-number">01 / TABS & GROUPS</span><h3>All your tabs,<br/><em>in a good place.</em></h3><p>Keep your tabs in sight, group related pages and pick up where you left off. Click a tab or collapse the group in the preview.</p><a href="#spaces">Explore Workspaces <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="feature-visual"><PreviewFrame mode="tabs" label="Interactive preview of Idle tabs and groups" /></div></section>
<section class="feature feature-cream reverse" id="spaces"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-number">02 / WORKSPACES & PROFILES</span><h3>One browser.<br/><em>Many little worlds.</em></h3><p>Give each project its own Workspace. Switch between Personal and Work Profiles to keep browsing sessions separate. Try the switcher and Workspace icons.</p><a href="#split">Explore Split View <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="feature-visual"><PreviewFrame mode="spaces" label="Interactive preview of Idle Profiles and Workspaces" /></div></section>
<section class="feature feature-lavender" id="split"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-number">03 / SPLIT VIEW</span><h3>More room<br/><em>for your ideas.</em></h3><p>See pages side by side. Toggle Split View in the preview, or drag a tab into the page in Idle to choose where it belongs.</p><a href="#peek">Discover Peek <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="feature-visual"><PreviewFrame mode="split" label="Interactive preview of Idle Split View" /></div></section>
<section class="feature feature-sage reverse" id="peek"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-number">04 / PEEK</span><h3>Take a look,<br/><em>stay right here.</em></h3><p>Preview a link without leaving your page. Try the preview link, then close Peek to return to what you were doing.</p><a href="#later">Discover Later <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="feature-visual"><PreviewFrame mode="peek" label="Interactive preview of Peek" /></div></section>
<section class="feature feature-cream" id="later"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-number">05 / LATER & FAVOURITES</span><h3>Keep the good<br/><em>things close.</em></h3><p>Save pages to Later when you want to come back. Find Later, Favourites and history together in your Library. Try saving a page in the preview.</p><a href="#appearance">Make it yours <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="feature-visual"><PreviewFrame mode="later" label="Interactive preview of Idle Library and Later" /></div></section>
<section class="feature feature-lavender reverse" id="appearance"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-number">06 / APPEARANCE</span><h3>A browser that<br/><em>feels like yours.</em></h3><p>Choose light, dark or system appearance and a subtle browser tint. Try the real appearance controls here.</p><a href={welcome ? '#start' : '#download'}>{welcome ? 'Start browsing' : 'Get to know Idle'} <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="feature-visual"><PreviewFrame mode="appearance" label="Interactive preview of Idle appearance settings" /></div></section>
